WEBVTT

00:00.220 --> 00:01.881
You're calling Morrison Law Group.

00:02.185 --> 00:04.980
This is the firm's virtual intake assistant.

00:05.540 --> 00:06.770
How can I help you today?

00:09.110 --> 00:12.640
Um, I need to make an appointment for a consultation.

00:13.760 --> 00:14.340
Sure.

00:14.640 --> 00:16.440
May I have your first and last name?

00:17.950 --> 00:18.570
Steven

00:20.790 --> 00:22.310
And this is Steven Smith.

00:23.100 --> 00:24.000
Thank you, Steven.

00:24.470 --> 00:27.590
Will you be filing individually or jointly with a spouse?

00:29.200 --> 00:30.250
Individually

00:32.630 --> 00:33.010
Got it.

00:33.520 --> 00:37.770
Do you currently own a business or have you owned one in the last few years?

00:38.870 --> 00:39.320
No.

00:40.920 --> 00:41.440
Okay.

00:42.000 --> 00:44.630
Now let's get you a free consultation.

00:44.970 --> 00:46.750
What day and time work best for you?

00:51.030 --> 00:53.230
Thursday or Friday would be best.

00:54.580 --> 00:58.980
We can do Zoom or meet in Sandy, Ogden, or Orem.

00:59.550 --> 01:00.830
What works best for you?

01:02.190 --> 01:02.860
Zoom.

01:07.450 --> 01:07.840
Got it.

01:08.230 --> 01:09.050
Zoom works.

01:09.700 --> 01:13.180
What time of day on Thursday or Friday works best for you?

01:13.690 --> 01:14.820
Morning or afternoon?

01:14.830 --> 01:16.410
After three o'clock.

01:17.630 --> 01:19.640
Let's look at Thursday first.

01:20.110 --> 01:24.370
Please confirm the Thursday date you mean, and I'll check for available appointment

01:24.370 --> 01:26.190
slots after three in the afternoon.

01:30.770 --> 01:32.820
Yeah, this Thursday would be great, after three

01:35.160 --> 01:37.260
Let me check for available appointment slots.

01:37.540 --> 01:38.080
One moment.

01:38.350 --> 01:43.400
I can offer Thursday at three in the afternoon or Thursday at four.

01:43.980 --> 01:45.610
Which time would you like me to book?

01:46.980 --> 01:47.880
Four o'clock.

01:49.050 --> 01:49.570
Great.

01:50.000 --> 01:52.350
I can book the four in the afternoon slot.

01:52.880 --> 01:55.670
What's the best email to send your intake questionnaire to?

01:56.430 --> 01:58.690
Please say it slowly, and I'll repeat it back.

02:11.230 --> 02:13.460
Let me book the appointment for you.

02:15.340 --> 02:15.940
Perfect.

02:16.200 --> 02:18.250
One moment while I finalize that for you.

02:18.530 --> 02:21.860
You're all set for Thursday at four in the afternoon.

02:22.590 --> 02:24.040
I have your email and

02:30.330 --> 02:33.650
You'll get the intake form and a confirmation text shortly.

02:34.310 --> 02:37.980
Please complete the form before your appointment so the attorney can prepare.

02:39.050 --> 02:41.140
Is there anything else I can help with, Steven?

02:42.570 --> 02:43.310
Thank you.

02:43.340 --> 02:43.780
Nope

02:48.950 --> 02:50.600
You're very welcome, Steven.

02:50.880 --> 02:52.820
Thank you for calling Morrison Law Group.

02:53.180 --> 02:54.310
Have a great afternoon.
